# Build-context exclusions for the worker image build. Everything the
# Dockerfile COPYs must stay OUT of this list: src/, workers/,
# pyproject.toml, README.md, build_support.py, docs/SPECIALIST_WORKFLOW.md,
# scripts/run_specialist_quality_experiment.py and the four audit test
# files named in src/asea/_package_resources.py AUDIT_ORIGINS.
.git
.capability-build
dist-vercel
data
node_modules
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache